### 0. 登录（不拦截，自动把 token 存到全局变量）
POST http://localhost:8080/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.data.token);
%}

### 1. 阅览室列表
GET http://localhost:8080/rooms
Authorization: {{token}}

### 2. 时段列表
GET http://localhost:8080/slots
Authorization: {{token}}

### 3. 座位列表（1号阅览室 + 1号时段，返回 10 个座位）
GET http://localhost:8080/seats?roomId=1&slotId=1
Authorization: {{token}}

### 4. 预约座位（返回 "预约成功"）
POST http://localhost:8080/reserve
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "seatId": 1,
  "roomId": 1,
  "slotId": 1
}

### 5.【可选】我的预约
GET http://localhost:8080/reservations
Authorization: {{token}}

### 6.【可选】公告列表
GET http://localhost:8080/notices
Authorization: {{token}}
